The Katzar-Khat has entrusted me with a message for you {name}.

{arialbld}Escape while you can.{arial}{pause}

I must also warn you that if you stick to Tyron Spirex's stupid SASHIMI plan, you will be sending the Nikonese girl, Mayumi Bazuka, to a brutal death. Her fate will be even more gruesome if Fedor Kharkan manages to capture her alive... You must have heard about his lively imagination regarding torture...{pause}

In case you're taking this threat lightly {rank}, accept my humble advice, you have no hope of winning this battle. You don't even know what awaits you. Fedor Kharkan now clenches a terrible weapon which shall be your annihilation. If you think I'm bluffing, have a look at this photo.{pause}












{center}{device14}











{pause}You won't come out of it this time.{pause}

Not without my help...{pause}


You and I can rid Katzarin of that beastly Fedor Kharkan. What do you think?  Together we can do great things {name}. I've got something better than some medal to offer you {rank}: POWER. Make me your right-hand man, and I will be your loyal counsellor. Today Katzarin and tomorrow, with this weapon whose technology I shall give you, we will take over THE WORLD.


Katzar-Khat {name}, this title fits you like a glove!
You just have to take this chance...



{offset150}{arialbld}Padir Natkrof{arial}

Of Greater Katzarin, the Zirgol.


